      "source": "; Generated by Web64 from a .w64traj authoring asset.\n; Runtime data remains raw signed dx, signed dy, unsigned duration triplets.\n; This include declares constants and an optional descriptor helper only.\n; It does not import a runtime, choose a load address, or own placement.\nshared_loop_segment_count = 8\nshared_loop_byte_size = 24\nshared_loop_default_options = $1000\n\n; Caller-owned placement example:\n; .incbin shared_loop_segments, \"assets/trajectories/shared-loop.traj\"\n\n; Invoke after defining/importing the segment label shown above.\n.macro shared_loop_emit_pattern\n    .word shared_loop_segments\n    .word shared_loop_segment_count\n.endmacro\n"
